  Mode: 117
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Stingherd
  Description: 'Jacks only - herd your danger creatures into rival hulls. Part of your herd is
    dangerous; run your jacks behind it and it swims away from them, toward whoever you want
    stung. A danger creature that touches a rival stings it - one point - and is spent, so
    keep your herd fed and big. The tadpoles grazing the kelp join a herd that comes near
    them. On the easy levels half your herd is dangerous and it goes for rivals by itself;
    on the hardest only a quarter, in the thickest kelp. First team to the target wins.'
